"macOS asks every app that takes screenshots for this permission.\n\nOpen System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording, turn on %@, then quit and reopen it.\n\nNot in the list? Click + below it and add %@ from Applications.\n\nAlready on? A rebuilt or moved copy counts as a new app: select it, remove it with −, then reopen %@ and allow it again." = "macOS isteqsi yal asnas iṭṭfen tuṭṭfiwin n ugdil ɣef turagt-agi.\n\nLdi Iɣewwaṛen n unagraw › Taɣellist d tɣellist › Asekles n ugdil d yimesli n unagraw, rmed %@, sakin ffeɣ seg-s u ldi-t daɣen.\n\nUlac-it deg tebdart? Senned ɣef + ddaw-s u rnu %@ seg Yisnasen.\n\nYermed yakan? Anɣal yettwasnifel neɣ yettwamutti yettwaḥseb d asnas amaynut: fren-itt, kkes-itt s −, sakin ldi %@ daɣen u sireg-it daɣen.";

